          "id": "showcase-reply",
          "role": "bot",
          "kind": "text",
          "at": 1791276100000,
          "text": "## A Saturday, unhurried\nStart with a walk beside the river, then lunch at **Willow Café**. I found a sheltered path and left plenty of breathing room.\n\n- Take the riverside loop, not the busy road.\n- Bring a light jacket; the morning could be cool.\n\n### Before you go\n- [x] Check the café’s opening hours\n- [x] Save the walking route\n- [ ] Confirm the table by phone\n\nThe reservation page timed out, so the table is **not booked yet**. Their number is in `plans/weekend.md`.\n\n> Nothing here needs an early alarm.\n\n```text\n10:30  Riverside walk\n12:00  Lunch at Willow Café\n14:00  Take the scenic way home\n```\n\n| Stop | Time | Budget |\n| :--- | :---: | ---: |\n| Riverside loop | 10:30 | Free |\n| Willow Café | 12:00 | £28 |\n| Bookshop | 13:15 | £12 |\n\nYou can swap the bookshop for a little longer by the water.",
          "turnId": "showcase-turn",
          "turnTerminal": true,
          "turnSucceeded": false,
          "parentId": "showcase-plan-done"
        },
